hifiberry-analog-recognition (0.2.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Only start the service on cards with an analog input. Gate the systemd
    user service with ExecCondition on `config-soundcard --input-channels`,
    so output-only and digital-only (S/PDIF, e.g. Digi+) cards where
    input_channels=0 skip the service cleanly instead of running with no
    capture source.
  * Depend on hifiberry-configurator (provides config-soundcard).

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Mon, 06 Jul 2026 14:00:00 +0000

hifiberry-analog-recognition (0.2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Register as a HiFiBerryOS player plugin (webui players.d + configserver
    permission + ACR players.d drop-in) via postinst/postrm.
  * Add "Recognize tracks" setting: when off, publish "Unknown artist" /
    "Unknown song" instead of running songrec.
  * Depend on hifiberry-audiocontrol and hifiberry-vu-meter.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Mon, 06 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000

hifiberry-analog-recognition (0.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * songrec-based track recognition on the analog input
  * VU-meter-based play/stop state, independent of recognition cadence
  * Publishes both into AudioControl as a generic player ("analog")

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Sun, 05 Jul 2026 20:00:00 +0000
